<Base path="/vocom-ai-agents">
<div class="desktop xqfcrwz"><div class="site-header-slot header-slot" data-pagefind-ignore><Header /></div><section class="hero xypmwzd"><div class="xvxx4ml"><div class="xjfxc9q fb"><p class="xijv5kh">VOCOM AI</p></div><h1 class="xzgwc1d">RenOS: The Operating System for Your AI Agents</h1><p class="xozgzol">Run AI agents across any model your team uses. RenOS decides which model handles each task under your rules, explains why in plain language, and writes an audit trail automatically.</p><div class="xwlvntp"><a class="button-primary xtd8jbj" href="/contact-vocomai"><p class="xl4u3rf">Book a Live Demo</p></a><a class="button-primary xzyxamh" href="/vocom-ai-agents#how-it-works"><p class="xl4u3rf">See How It Works</p></a></div></div><div class="x2zzlbe"><div class="x2su6bo"><div class="xd9ftla"><img class="fill-img" src="/assets/img/vocom-ai-agents-aa323d.webp" srcset="/assets/img/vocom-ai-agents-aa323d-512w.webp 512w, /assets/img/vocom-ai-agents-aa323d.webp 1000w" sizes="(min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 100vw, (max-width: 809.98px) 100vw, 100vw" width="1000" height="700" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div></div></div></section><section class="cost-savings xv2syoq"><div class="xlr6yrc"><div class="xrxazuy"><div class="x3kx640"><p class="xzjhq3k">RenOS: Admin Dashboard</p></div><div class="xzcnit3"><p class="xlulvxq">TEAMS</p><div class="xuv4fst"><div class="xvwrngi"><p class="xmdmnrj">Sales</p><p class="xgnstoa">Reasoning Model</p></div><p class="xxiwmrb">Cap set</p></div><div class="xuv4fst"><div class="xvwrngi"><p class="xmdmnrj">Support</p><p class="xgnstoa">Fast Draft Model</p></div><p class="xxiwmrb">Lighter model</p></div><div class="xuv4fst"><div class="xvwrngi"><p class="xmdmnrj">Marketing</p><p class="xgnstoa">Lightweight Model</p></div><p class="xxiwmrb">Cap set</p></div><p class="xuiq2qs">Per-team spend caps applied automatically</p></div></div></div><div class="xwwn4xs"><h2 class="x1basey">Spend Less on Every AI Task</h2><p class="xnjepd6">RenOS routes each task to the model that can do the job for the lowest cost, not whichever tool happens to be open. Teams on RenOS stop paying for five overlapping subscriptions and start paying only for the work that gets done.</p></div></section><section class="governance xz1cbc4"><div class="xwwn4xs"><h2 class="x1basey">Govern and Audit Every Agent</h2><p class="xnjepd6">Every task RenOS routes comes with a plain-language reason and a permanent record: who ran it, which model handled it, which policy applied, and what it cost. Nothing runs outside the record your admin can read.</p></div><div class="xlr6yrc"><div class="xrxazuy"><div class="x3kx640"><p class="xzjhq3k">RenOS: Audit Trail</p></div><div class="xzcnit3"><p class="xlulvxq">RECENT ACTIVITY</p><div class="xsz28t3"><p class="x1vlapd">Draft renewal email</p><p class="xljisui">Reasoning Model · Sales, Standard policy</p></div><div class="xsz28t3"><p class="x1vlapd">Summarize support tickets</p><p class="xljisui">Fast Draft Model · Support, Routine policy</p></div><div class="xsz28t3"><p class="x1vlapd">Draft policy memo</p><p class="xljisui">Frontier Model · Compliance, Sensitive policy</p></div><p class="xuiq2qs">Exportable for compliance review</p></div></div></div></section><section class="problem xnvmk0i"><h2 class="x9oz6bi">Your Team Already Uses AI. Can You Prove What It Did?</h2><p class="xzv18pc">Most teams now use five or more AI tools, each billed separately, none of the AI talking to each other, and nobody can show who ran what on which model with what data. RenOS puts one governed layer across all of it.</p></section><section class="how-it-works xh1neic" id="how-it-works"><h2 class="xrvciip">How RenOS Works</h2><div class="xwozren"><div class="xgikefw fb"><p class="xmv4rx0">01</p><p class="xrfyzq9">Submit a Task</p><p class="xtdjkpm">Type a request in Chat Mode, start a Builder task, or let an Agent pick it up. You never have to choose a model yourself.</p></div><div class="xgikefw fb"><p class="xmv4rx0">02</p><p class="xrfyzq9">Policy Decides</p><p class="xtdjkpm">RenOS checks your admin’s rules for the task type, the data involved, and your role, then picks the model before the task runs.</p></div><div class="xgikefw fb"><p class="xmv4rx0">03</p><p class="xrfyzq9">Routing Rationale</p><p class="xtdjkpm">You see which model ran the task and a one-line reason why, in plain language, not a confidence score.</p></div><div class="xgikefw fb"><p class="xmv4rx0">04</p><p class="xrfyzq9">Audit Trail</p><p class="xtdjkpm">Every task, model, and decision is logged automatically, ready to export the moment compliance asks.</p></div></div></section><section class="three-ways-to-work xkfpnx0"><h2 class="xrvciip">Chat, Builder and Agent Modes</h2><div class="xkjv6mq"><div class="xqzqle4 fb"><p class="x5yly0f">Chat</p><p class="xtdjkpm">Ask a question or hand off a task. RenOS routes it to the right model and shows you why.</p></div><div class="xqzqle4 fb"><p class="x5yly0f">Builder</p><p class="xtdjkpm">Run a task across more than one model side by side and compare the results before you commit.</p></div><div class="xqzqle4 fb"><p class="x5yly0f">Agent</p><p class="xtdjkpm">Let agents work together on one task under your rules, with every handoff recorded.</p></div></div></section><section class="ai-coaching-agents x23sz06" id="coaching"><h2 class="x9oz6bi">AI Coaching Agents for Sales, Leadership and Frontline Teams</h2><p class="xzv18pc">Coaching started as its own product, Vocom AI Coach Hub. It’s now built into RenOS as a set of coaching agents covering recruiting, sales, leadership and frontline teams, so coaching activity sits inside the same governed system as every other agent.</p><div class="xkjv6mq"><div class="xlokxt6 fb"><h3 class="xrfyzq9">Sales Practice</h3><p class="xtdjkpm">Scenario simulation and real-time feedback for pitch, negotiation and service conversations.</p></div><div class="xlokxt6 fb"><h3 class="xrfyzq9">Leadership Development</h3><p class="xtdjkpm">Simulated dialogue and 9-box reporting for succession and promotion readiness.</p></div><div class="xlokxt6 fb"><h3 class="xrfyzq9">Frontline Skill Building</h3><p class="xtdjkpm">Guided coaching with progress tracking for onboarding, support and frontline service roles.</p></div></div><div class="xonijnm"><p class="x8gswed">COACH HUB DEPLOYMENTS</p><div class="xmhhkbk"><div class="xlksddn"><p class="xof3sqp">Finance</p><p class="xydgpk2">50% fewer training hours</p></div><div class="xlksddn"><p class="xof3sqp">Healthcare</p><p class="xydgpk2">60 to 70% lower nursing workload</p></div><div class="xlksddn"><p class="xof3sqp">Retail</p><p class="xydgpk2">3 hours a day reclaimed</p></div></div></div></section><section class="why-renos xkfpnx0"><h2 class="xrvciip">Why Teams Choose RenOS</h2><div class="xkjv6mq"><div class="xfvydhh"><h3 class="xduwxrq">Any Model, One Place</h3><p class="xmwnh5q">Hundreds of models behind one interface, so your team stops paying for five overlapping subscriptions.</p></div><div class="xfvydhh"><h3 class="xduwxrq">Neutral by Design</h3><p class="xmwnh5q">RenOS does not belong to any model vendor, so it can route and log every one of them the same way.</p></div><div class="xfvydhh"><h3 class="xduwxrq">Admin Visibility</h3><p class="xmwnh5q">One dashboard shows every session, model, and spend amount, by person or by team, without anyone having to ask.</p></div><div class="xfvydhh"><h3 class="xduwxrq">Private Deployment Option</h3><p class="xmwnh5q">Run RenOS inside your own environment as an add-on, so sensitive data never has to leave it.</p></div><div class="xfvydhh"><h3 class="xduwxrq">Nothing Extra for Users</h3><p class="xmwnh5q">Governance happens in the background. People submit a task in Chat, Builder, or Agent mode and just get their work done.</p></div><div class="xfvydhh"><h3 class="xduwxrq">Human Handoff</h3><p class="xmwnh5q">Agents escalate to your team the moment a task needs a person to step in.</p></div></div></section><section class="teams xxrsy07"><p class="xrgfufh">Built for the Teams That Answer for Their AI</p><p class="xgunlfm">Different teams submit different work. RenOS applies the right policy to each one without anyone having to think about it.</p><div class="xvbn7jw"><div class="xyyhxe8 fb"><p class="xemrxsg">Sales</p></div><div class="xyyhxe8 fb"><p class="xemrxsg">Compliance</p></div><div class="xyyhxe8 fb"><p class="xemrxsg">IT</p></div><div class="xyyhxe8 fb"><p class="xemrxsg">Operations</p></div><div class="xyyhxe8 fb"><p class="xemrxsg">Leadership Coaching</p></div><div class="xyyhxe8 fb"><p class="xemrxsg">Finance</p></div></div></section><section class="who-it-s-for xxrsy07"><h2 class="xrgfufh">Governed AI, Built Around Your Industry</h2><p class="xgunlfm">RenOS adapts to the rules your industry already runs on, from data handling to who is allowed to approve what.</p><div class="xvbn7jw"><div class="xyyhxe8 fb"><p class="xemrxsg">Healthcare</p></div><div class="xyyhxe8 fb"><p class="xemrxsg">Credit Unions</p></div><div class="xyyhxe8 fb"><p class="xemrxsg">Real Estate</p></div><div class="xyyhxe8 fb"><p class="xemrxsg">Professional Services</p></div><div class="xyyhxe8 fb"><p class="xemrxsg">Telecom &amp; MSPs</p></div><div class="xyyhxe8 fb"><p class="xemrxsg">Dental Groups</p></div><div class="xyyhxe8 fb"><p class="xemrxsg">Property Management</p></div><div class="xyyhxe8 fb"><p class="xemrxsg">Insurance</p></div><div class="xyyhxe8 fb"><p class="xemrxsg">Fintech</p></div></div></section><section class="pilot xsbvf30"><h2 class="xpvj06s">Start With a 60-Day Pilot</h2><p class="xdgej2a">A 60-day design-partner pilot with a written success plan, run on one real workflow from your team.</p><a class="button-primary xtd8jbj" href="/contact-vocomai"><p class="xl4u3rf">Talk to Us About a Pilot</p></a></section><section class="faq x23sz06" id="faq"><h2 class="xrvciip">RenOS Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div class="xs2pw4d"><div class="faq-accordian-item-2 xzkh4c6"><FaqItem question="What is RenOS?">RenOS is Vocom AI's AI operating system for AI agents. It routes each task to the right model under your rules, explains the choice in plain language, and logs everything automatically.</FaqItem></div><div class="faq-accordian-item-2 xzkh4c6"><FaqItem question="How is RenOS different from a single AI assistant?">A single assistant is tied to one model and one interface. RenOS sits above all of them, choosing the model per task and keeping one governed record across every tool your team uses.</FaqItem></div><div class="faq-accordian-item-2 xzkh4c6"><FaqItem question="Which AI models does RenOS work with?">RenOS is designed to work across a wide range of models rather than lock you into one. Which models are enabled is set by your admin's policy.</FaqItem></div><div class="faq-accordian-item-2 xzkh4c6"><FaqItem question="Where does our data go?">Routing decisions and task metadata are logged for your admin to review. Where the underlying task content goes depends on which model handles it and the deployment option you choose.</FaqItem></div><div class="faq-accordian-item-2 xzkh4c6"><FaqItem question="Can RenOS run in our own environment?">Yes. A private deployment option is available so sensitive data stays inside your own environment.</FaqItem></div><div class="faq-accordian-item-2 xzkh4c6"><FaqItem question="What happened to Vocom AI Coach Hub?">Coaching is now part of RenOS as coaching agents, covering sales, leadership and frontline skill building in the same platform.</FaqItem></div><div class="faq-accordian-item-2 xzkh4c6"><FaqItem question="Will our existing systems work with RenOS?">RenOS is built to sit alongside the tools your team already uses rather than replace them. Talk to us about your specific systems during a pilot.</FaqItem></div><div class="faq-accordian-item-2 xzkh4c6"><FaqItem question="How do we get started?">Start with a 60-day pilot on one real workflow, or book a live demo to see routing and the audit trail on a task of your own.</FaqItem></div></div></section><section class="final-cta xxelqfj"><h2 class="xp4a4uu">See RenOS Run on Your Own Work</h2><p class="x64lv4a">Bring one real task and we’ll route it live, rationale and audit trail included.</p><div class="x50ehlf"><a class="button-primary xtd8jbj" href="/contact-vocomai"><p class="xl4u3rf">Book a Demo</p></a><a class="button-primary xzyxamh" href="/vocom-ai"><p class="xl4u3rf">Explore Vocom AI</p></a></div></section><div class="simple-footer-2 xzxrxrs footer-slot" data-pagefind-ignore><Footer footerTagline="One Platform. One Partner. Future-Ready" title="Quick Links" menu1="VOCOM" menu2="Services" menu3="RenOS AI Agents" link1="/" link2="/vocom-services" link3="/vocom-ai-agents" /></div></div>
</Base>
